## Summary

Addresses #591 — eliminates unbounded PostCommit overhead from zombie ENDED sessions.

### Three layered components:

1. **Eager condense on session stop** (happy path, ~95% of cases)
   - When a session stops, eagerly condense remaining data via `CondenseSessionByID`
   - Marks session `FullyCondensed` so PostCommit skips it entirely
   - One-time ~100-200ms cost at stop time vs O(N × commits) forever

